OHOS: recordings are staged in the app sandbox, and the system-tray
notification used by other platforms is never shown on OHOS (the tray is
intentionally disabled there), so the existing OpenRecording notification
action is unreachable. Offer the DocumentViewPicker as soon as a recording
is finalized, except for copy-only finishes, reusing the existing
RecordingFileExport path.

